Q1 -- HOW MUCH DO OUTCOMES CLUSTER BY REPOSITORY?
==========================================================================
  outcome = executes without exception                
     repositories 685, executions 4169, mean cluster size m0 = 6.06
     ICC = 0.435   design effect = 3.20   effective n = 1302 (not 4169)

  outcome = executes AND matches the recorded output  
     repositories 685, executions 4169, mean cluster size m0 = 6.06
     ICC = 0.335   design effect = 2.70   effective n = 1547 (not 4169)

  repositories contributing >= 3 executions: 364
  of those, repositories where EVERY execution had the same outcome: 281 (77.2%)
  -> a repository is close to a single Bernoulli trial, not to m independent ones.

