    year   age |  nb_succ   nb_tot  nb_rate |  rp_succ   rp_tot  rp_rate | top-repo share of cohort successes
    2010    11 |        5       25    20.0% |        2        3    66.7% |     60% (3 of 5)
    2011    10 |        2        9    22.2% |        1        3    33.3% |    100% (2 of 2)
